    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD design</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Uber</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Stock Exchange / Order Matching</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Learn how an exchange pairs buyers with sellers fairly, in a strict order, in microseconds, and how it can crash and come back with exactly the same state. It is the one HLD question where \"add more servers and a database\" is the wrong answer.</p>\n      "
